  "content": {
    "id": "p29-q3-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "For a positive integer $n$, consider the expansion:\n\n$$(1+x)^{2n}={}^{2n}C_0+{}^{2n}C_1x+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n}x^{2n}\\qquad(*)$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p29-q3-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Show that ${}^{2n}C_0+{}^{2n}C_1+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n}=2^{2n}$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Substituting $x=1$ into (*) gives ${}^{2n}C_0+{}^{2n}C_1+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n}=2^{2n}$.",
          "worked": "Substitute $x=1$ into (*):\n\n$$\\begin{align*}(1+1)^{2n}&={}^{2n}C_0+{}^{2n}C_1+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n}\\\\2^{2n}&={}^{2n}C_0+{}^{2n}C_1+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p29-q3-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Show that ${}^{2n}C_1+{}^{2n}C_3+{}^{2n}C_5+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n-1}=2^{2n-1}$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Substitute $x=-1$ into (*). The odd-indexed and even-indexed sums are equal; by part a their total is $2^{2n}$, so each is $2^{2n-1}$.",
          "worked": "Substitute $x=-1$ into (*):\n\n$$\\begin{align*}(1-1)^{2n}&={}^{2n}C_0-{}^{2n}C_1+{}^{2n}C_2-\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n}\\\\0&={}^{2n}C_0-{}^{2n}C_1+{}^{2n}C_2-\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n}.\\end{align*}$$\n\nHence the odd-indexed sum equals the even-indexed sum:\n\n$${}^{2n}C_1+{}^{2n}C_3+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n-1}={}^{2n}C_0+{}^{2n}C_2+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n}.$$\n\nBy part a, these two sums have total $2^{2n}$. Therefore,\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\left({}^{2n}C_1+{}^{2n}C_3+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n-1}\\right)&=2^{2n}\\\\{}^{2n}C_1+{}^{2n}C_3+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n-1}&=2^{2n-1}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      }
    ]
  },
